'''Illypnian Baliscans''' ({{lang-bl|Baliscanos Ilipnianos}} or ''illipno-baliscanos'') are a [[W:Panethnicity|pan-ethnic]] group in the [[Baliscan Confederation]], consisting of Baliscan residents of full or partial [[W:Ethnic groups in Europe|Illypnian ancestry]], inclusive of all regions of the continent. According to the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]], people solely identifying as Illypnian constituted roughly 26.94% of the Baliscan population. When taking into account the number of people also identifying with [[Mestizo Baliscans|multiple ethnicities]], this proportion rises to 30.22%.

